	<item>
		<title>Southern Highland Pasture Raised Lamb</title>
		<link>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/southern-highland-pasture-raised-lamb/</link>
					<comments>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/southern-highland-pasture-raised-lamb/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[farmerbutcher_t66bou]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Thu, 13 Feb 2025 22:26:33 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=18641</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Our Ewes and Lambs are pasture fed year round on sown Millet, Sorghum and Winter Oats along with our improved pastures of Rye, Cocksfoot and Clover.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Cuts:</strong></li>
<li>2 x Leg Roast</li>
<li>2 x Shanks</li>
<li>Cutlets</li>
<li>Forequater Chops</li>
<li>Loin Chops</li>
<li>Chump Chops</li>
<li>Neck Chops</li>
<li>Ribletts</li>
<li>Butchers option Premium Mince or Lamb Sausages</li>
<li>Offal is not available with full body due to ageing times</li>
</ul>
<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/southern-highland-pasture-raised-lamb/">Southern Highland Pasture Raised Lamb</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/southern-highland-pasture-raised-lamb/">Southern Highland Pasture Raised Lamb</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
