		<item>
		<title>Southern Highlands Pasture Raised Beef, Lamb and Pork Pack</title>
		<link>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/southern-highlands-pasture-raised-beef-lamb-and-pork-pack/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[farmerbutcher_t66bou]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 31 Jan 2025 22:54:47 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=17924</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p style="font-weight: 400;"><strong><em>Grass Fed Beef – 25kg</em></strong></p>
<ul style="font-weight: 400;">
<li>Scotch fillet</li>
<li>Rump Steak</li>
<li>Blade Steak</li>
<li>Y Bone Blade Steak</li>
<li>Round Steak</li>
<li>Chuck Steak</li>
<li>Minute Steak</li>
<li>Osso Bucco</li>
<li>Asado Beef Ribs</li>
<li>Diced Beef</li>
<li>80/20 Premium Beef Mince</li>
<li>Beef Sausages</li>
<li>Roast</li>
<li>French Silverside</li>
<li>Fat (Perfect for Tallow)</li>
<li>Stew Bones (Cut)</li>
</ul>
<p style="font-weight: 400;">
<p style="font-weight: 400;"><strong><em>Pasture Raised Lamb – 10kg</em></strong></p>
<ul style="font-weight: 400;">
<li>Forequarter Chops</li>
<li>Cutlets</li>
<li>Loin Chops</li>
<li>Riblets</li>
<li>Leg Roast</li>
<li>Neck</li>
<li>Shank</li>
</ul>
<p style="font-weight: 400;">
<p style="font-weight: 400;"><strong><em>Free Range Pork – 15kg</em></strong></p>
<ul style="font-weight: 400;">
<li>Medallions</li>
<li>Forequarter Chops</li>
<li>Schnitzel</li>
<li>Pork Roasts</li>
<li>Pork shank</li>
</ul>
<p style="font-weight: 400;">
<p style="font-weight: 400;">All of our sausages are gluten free</p>
<p style="font-weight: 400;">
<p style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Cattle Health:</strong></p>
<p style="font-weight: 400;">Our cattle are pasture fed year round on sown Millet, Sorghum and Winter Oats along with our improved pastures of Rye, Cocksfoot and Clover.</p>
<p style="font-weight: 400;">Our Cattle are Multimined, Ultra Vaccinated and Drenched on their cycle.</p>
<p style="font-weight: 400;">NO mRNA Vaccines have ever been used on our farms livestock.</p>
<p style="font-weight: 400;">
<p style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Processing:</strong></p>
<p style="font-weight: 400;">Our livestock is loaded weekly on a Wednesday evening and transported to the abattoir a short 30 min drive away, where we have priority processing very early the next morning, following a 12 – 16 hour chill in the abattoirs chilling rooms the bodies of beef are then cold transported to our butcher for hanging  with an average of 7-10 days, the beast is then butchered and packaged to your selected options before being delivered the very same day.</p>
<p style="font-weight: 400;">
<p style="font-weight: 400;">Please allow up to 14 days for processing from time of order.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/southern-highlands-pasture-raised-beef-lamb-and-pork-pack/">Southern Highlands Pasture Raised Beef, Lamb and Pork Pack</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/southern-highlands-pasture-raised-beef-lamb-and-pork-pack/">Southern Highlands Pasture Raised Beef, Lamb and Pork Pack</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
		
		
