		<item>
		<title>Southern Highlands Pasture Fed Angus Beef – 1/4th Beast</title>
		<link>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/high-range-pasture-fed-angus-beef-1-4th-beast/</link>
					<comments>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/high-range-pasture-fed-angus-beef-1-4th-beast/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[farmerbutcher_t66bou]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 27 Nov 2024 18:32:57 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=15845</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>1/4 Angus Beef Pack – Mixed Cuts</p>
<p>The meat is juicy, flavorsome and tender.</p>
<p>Pasture fed yearling steers are processed between 400-450kg lwt.</p>
<p>Please note body will be hung for 7-10 days prior to butchering.</p>
<p>Full carcass weights average 200-220kg</p>
<p>Price is 1/4 Body, Bone In</p>
<p><strong>Cuts:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Eye Fillet</li>
<li>4 x Rump Steak</li>
<li>8 x New York Steak</li>
<li>4 x Scotch Fillet Steak</li>
<li>4 x Blade Steak</li>
<li>3 x Round Steak</li>
<li>8 x Chuck Steak</li>
<li>12 x Minute Steak</li>
<li>4 x Oyster Blade Steak</li>
<li>4 x Osso Bucco</li>
<li>Gravy Beef</li>
<li>Half x Silverside Roast</li>
<li>Half x Brisket</li>
<li>2 x Short Rib</li>
<li>6 kg Lean Mince</li>
<li>4kg Burger Patties</li>
<li>7 kg Sausages</li>
<li>8kg Bones (Optional)</li>
<li>1.5kg Fat (Tallow, Optional)</li>
<li>Offal is not offered on a 1/4 Box</li>
<li>All of our sausages are gluten free</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Cattle Health:</strong></p>
<p>Our cattle are pasture fed year round on sown Millet, Sorghum and Winter Oats along with our improved pastures of Rye, Cocksfoot and Clover.</p>
<p>NO mRNA Vaccines have ever been used on our farms livestock.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p><strong>Processing:</strong></p>
<p>Our livestock is loaded weekly on a Wednesday evening and transported to the abattoir a short 30 min drive away, where we have priority processing very early the next morning, following a 12 – 16 hour chill in the abattoirs chilling rooms the bodies of beef are then cold transported to our butcher for hanging  with an average of 7-10 days, the beast is then butchered and packaged to your selected options before being delivered the very same day.</p>
<p>Due to a custom order please allow up to 21 days for processing from time of order.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/high-range-pasture-fed-angus-beef-1-4th-beast/">Southern Highlands Pasture Fed Angus Beef – 1/4th Beast</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/high-range-pasture-fed-angus-beef-1-4th-beast/">Southern Highlands Pasture Fed Angus Beef – 1/4th Beast</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
