		<item>
		<title>Southern Highlands Pasture Fed Angus Beef – 1/2 Beast</title>
		<link>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/high-range-pasture-fed-angus-beef-1-2-beast/</link>
					<comments>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/high-range-pasture-fed-angus-beef-1-2-beast/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[farmerbutcher_t66bou]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 27 Nov 2024 18:15:30 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=15837</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><strong>Southen Highlands Pasture Fed Angus Beef – 1/2 Body</strong></p>
<p>Once the order has been placed, we will be in contact with you to confirm your preferred cuts and the process timelines.</p>
<p>Please note body will be hung for 7-10 days prior to butchering.</p>
<p>Full body carcass weights average 200-220kg</p>
<p>Price is charged @ 100kg/Half Body including fat and bone.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p><strong>Cuts Sheet</strong><strong>: (We will contact you direct for your specific cut option post purchase)</strong></p>
<p><strong>Scotch Fillet – </strong>Whole / Sliced</p>
<p><strong>Gravy Beef – </strong>Diced / Minced</p>
<p><strong>Chuck – </strong>Diced / Whole / Sliced</p>
<p><strong>Silverside – </strong>Roast / Minced</p>
<p><strong>Topside – </strong>Whole / Strips/Sliced to Minute Steak</p>
<p><strong>Round – </strong>Roast / Sliced</p>
<p><strong>Eye Fillet – </strong>Whole / Sliced</p>
<p><strong>Rump – </strong>Whole / Sliced</p>
<p><strong>New York – </strong>Whole / Sliced</p>
<p><strong>Shin – </strong>Whole Osso Bucco / Slice / Diced</p>
<p><strong>Bolar – </strong>Blade Steak / Roast/Diced</p>
<p><strong>Oyster – </strong>Y Bone Steak / Oyster Blade Steak Boneless</p>
<p><strong>Brisket – </strong>Whole / Portioned/Mince</p>
<p><strong>Ribs – </strong>Full / Asado / Short Rib</p>
<p><strong>Beef Patties – </strong>Yes 4.8kg (Will be packed in trays of 200g x 4)      /    No - All Mince</p>
<p><strong>Mince - </strong>When preparing your beef, the butcher will make mince from all the off cuts and trimmings of your cow, will be packed in 1Kg Lots</p>
<p><strong>Thick Sausages –</strong> Traditional (Packed in 1Kg Lots, in Freezer Bags (Cryovac Squashes them)<strong>   </strong></p>
<p><strong>Bones – </strong>Yes / No</p>
<p><strong>Excess Fat for Tallow – </strong>Yes / No</p>
<p><strong>All of our sausages are gluten free</strong></p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p><strong>Cattle Health:</strong></p>
<p>Our cattle are pasture fed year round on sown Millet, Sorghum and Winter Oats along with our improved pastures of Rye, Cocksfoot and Clover.</p>
<p>Our Cattle are Multimined, Vaccinated and Drenched on their cycle.</p>
<p>NO mRNA Vaccines have ever been used on our farms livestock.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p><strong>Processing:</strong></p>
<p>Our livestock is loaded weekly on a Wednesday evening and transported to the abattoir a short 30 min drive away, where we have priority processing very early the next morning, following a 12 – 16 hour chill in the abattoirs chilling rooms the bodies of beef are then cold transported to our butcher for hanging  with an average of 7-10 days, the beast is then butchered and packaged to your selected options before being freighted the very same day.</p>
<p>Due to a custom order please allow 14-18 days for processing from time of order.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/high-range-pasture-fed-angus-beef-1-2-beast/">Southern Highlands Pasture Fed Angus Beef – 1/2 Beast</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/high-range-pasture-fed-angus-beef-1-2-beast/">Southern Highlands Pasture Fed Angus Beef – 1/2 Beast</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
